00:26:08.500 --> 00:26:09.390
MIKE ELTSUFIN:
Thanks for having us.

00:26:09.390 --> 00:26:10.240
PATRICK FLYNN: Yeah,
thank you very much.

00:26:10.240 --> 00:26:11.120
MIKE ELTSUFIN: That
