00:26:11.120 --> 00:26:11.580
MARK MANDEL: Cheers.

00:26:11.580 --> 00:26:12.660
MELANIE WARRICK: Thank
you, Patrick and Mike,

00:26:12.660 --> 00:26:13.930
for coming on the podcast.

00:26:13.930 --> 00:26:17.990
It was great to talk to you guys
